 "remarks": "Have you ever imagined living on prestigious South Avenue and strolling into town for dinner, shopping or ice cream on a beautiful New England evening? Welcome to highly sought-after Hathaway Common, where convenience, community and a peaceful setting come together. This bright and spacious 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home offers a wonderful floor plan with a dedicated dining area, fireplace and finished lower-level space, currently used as a home office. A private garage, central air and smart-home features add everyday ease. Enjoy private outdoor space, expansive lawns, abundant guest parking, a community pool and clubhouse, all without the worry of yard work or snow removal. Best of all is the exceptional location. Flat, walkable sidewalks connect you to New Canaan's vibrant village, award-winning restaurants, shops, library and Metro-North, as well as local schools and the YMCA. Mead Park is just moments away for tennis, pickleball, baseball and skating. A rare combination of space, tranquility and extraordinary convenience, this is New Canaan living at its best.",
